  "title": "Brownie Buddy Snack Mix",
  "description": "Rice cereal coated in melted chocolate and peanut butter is dusted in chocolate brownie mix and combined with candy and salted pretzels for a deliciously fun snack mix.",
  "authors": [
    "NicoleMcmom"
  ],
